Housekeeping Cleaner

We are seeking a Housekeeping Cleaner to join our team. The Housekeeping Cleaner ensures clean, sanitary, and welcoming environments by performing routine cleaning tasks across defined areas and maintaining hygiene standards.

About the Role:
In this role, you will perform cleaning duties to keep facilities clean, orderly, and well maintained. You will be responsible for cleaning surfaces, sweeping, mopping, dusting, and supporting general upkeep as part of a collaborative team.

Responsibilities:
- Clean and sanitize rooms and common areas
- Empty trash and dispose of waste properly
- Clean and stock restrooms
- Handle linens including collection, washing, and distribution as needed
- Care for furniture and other furnishings to maintain appearance
- Follow safety guidelines and report maintenance issues
- Maintain cleanliness of floors, surfaces, and fixtures

About Required Skills:
The following core competencies apply:
- Housekeeping
- Professional Cleaning
- Trash Pickup
- Linens
- Hygiene
- Furniture

Qualifications:
- Ability to perform physical tasks and work as part of a team
- Attention to detail and reliability
- Willingness to follow procedures and hygiene standards

What We Offer:
- A supportive work environment
- Training and development opportunities
- Flexible scheduling options

